This product includes the following third-party software:
- Shapely (BSD 3-Clause) - Geometry operations
- PyProj (MIT) - CRS transformations
- Pydantic (MIT) - Data validation
- HTTPX (BSD 3-Clause) - HTTP client
- FastAPI (MIT) - REST API framework
- Click (BSD 3-Clause) - CLI framework
- Rich (MIT) - Terminal formatting

Geospatial data services used:
- OpenStreetMap/Nominatim (ODbL) - Geocoding
- Open Elevation API - Elevation data
- OSRM (BSD 2-Clause) - Routing
- SpatioTemporal Asset Catalogs (STAC) - Satellite data discovery
